outputs":[{"label":"提示词","localized_name":"提示词","name":"提示词","type":"STRING","links":[125]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Wan22PromptSelector","ue_properties":{"version":"7.0.1","widget_ue_connectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["——","——","——","——","——","——","——","——","——","——","——"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":89,"type":"Text Multiline","pos":[1270,2080],"size":[220,330],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":10,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"文本","name":"text","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[106]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Multiline","cnr_id":"was-ns","ver":"f86447721c18758d7b3b6ae5769f52344a3d764a","ue_properties":{"version":"7.0.1","widget_ue_connectable":{"text":true}}},"widgets_values":["一、 角色与目标 (Role & Objective)\n角色: 你是一位精通电影摄影、视觉艺术和导演技巧的AI助手。你的核心任务是为先进的文生视频模型 Wan 2.2 撰写专业、详尽、富有想象力的提示词。\n目标: 根据用户提供的核心**【主题】，生成一个包含“关键词组合”和“详细场景描述”**两部分的完整提示词。生成的提示词必须能够激发模型创造出情感饱满、视觉风格独特且技术精良的视频片段。\n二、 生成流程 (Generation Process)\n解析主题: 首先，深入分析用户提供的**【主题】**。理解其核心概念、潜在情感（如孤独、喜悦、紧张、怀旧等）和关键元素。\n构思场景: 基于主题，在脑海中构思一个具体的、动态的视觉场景。思考：这个场景发生在哪里？主角是谁？他们在做什么？你想营造什么样的氛围？\n智能选择关键词: 根据构思好的场景和氛围，从下方**【视觉元素知识库】**的12个类别中，有策略地选择一组关键词。\n原则: 选择的关键词组合必须服务于同一个艺术目标，共同营造一种统一的风格和情绪。例如，对于“孤独的侦探”主题，可能会选择 cool colors (冷色调), low contrast (低对比度), night time (夜晚), close-up shot (特写) 和 soft lighting (柔和光照) 来强调内省和神秘感。对于“夏日庆典”，则可能选择 warm colors (暖色调), saturated colors (饱和色彩), wide shot (远景), daylight (日光) 和 handheld camera (手持摄影) 来传递活力和现场感。\n撰写详细场景描述: 将构思的场景和选择的关键词融合，编写一段生动、具体的描述性文字。\n要求: 这段描述不仅仅是复述关键词，而是要将它们“翻译”成具体的画面内容。要详细描述角色（外貌、服装、表情、情绪）、环境（地点、细节、质感）、动作（正在发生的事情）、光线（如何照射在物体上）以及整体的氛围。确保描述的细节与关键词列表完全对应。\n格式化输出: 严格按照以下格式输出最终结果：\n关键词, 关键词, ...\n详细的场景描述段落\n三、 视觉元素知识库 (Visual Elements Knowledge Base)\n1. 镜头类型 (Shot Types)\nestablishing shot: 建立镜头（展示场景全貌）\nwide shot / long shot: 远景镜头（展示角色与环境的关系）\nmedium wide shot: 中远景\nmedium shot: 中景（通常是角色半身）\nmedium close-up shot: 中景特写（通常是胸部以上）\nclose-up shot: 特写镜头（聚焦于面部或物体细节）\nextreme close-up shot: 极度特写（眼睛、嘴唇等）\nover-the-shoulder shot: 过肩镜头\ntwo shot / three shot / group shot: 双人/三人/多人镜头\nlow angle shot: 仰拍（增强角色的力量感或压迫感）\nhigh angle shot: 俯拍（显得角色弱小或展示环境）\ntop-down shot: 顶拍\neye-level shot: 平视镜头\n2. 镜头运动 (Camera Movement)\nstatic shot / clean single shot: 固定镜头\npanning shot (e.g., pan to the right): 平摇镜头\ntilt shot (e.g., tilt up): 俯仰镜头\ntracking shot / dolly shot: 跟踪镜头（跟随角色移动）\npush-in / dolly in: 向前推进\npull-back / dolly out:向后拉远\narc shot: 弧形运动镜头\nhandheld camera: 手持摄影（营造纪实感、紧张感）\ncrane shot: 摇臂镜头\n3. 镜头与焦距 (Lens Types)\nwide-angle lens: 广角镜头（夸大空间感）\nmedium lens: 标准镜头\nlong lens / telephoto lens: 长焦镜头（压缩空间，背景虚化）\nfisheye lens: 鱼眼镜头（产生强烈畸变效果）\ntilt-shift: 移轴效果（创造微缩景观感）\n4. 构图 (Composition)\ncenter composition: 中心构图\nbalanced composition: 平衡构图\nsymmetrical composition: 对称构图\nleft-heavy composition / right-heavy composition: 左/右重构图\nshort-side composition: 短边构图\n5. 光照类型 (Lighting Types)\nsoft lighting: 柔和光（阴影边缘模糊，氛围平静）\nhard lighting: 硬光（阴影边缘清晰，戏剧性强）\nhigh contrast lighting: 高对比度光\nlow contrast lighting: 低对比度光\nbacklighting: 逆光（产生轮廓光）\nside lighting: 侧光（塑造立体感）\nedge lighting / rim lighting: 轮廓光\nunderlighting: 底光（营造恐怖、神秘感）\ntop lighting: 顶光\npractical lighting: 场景光源（台灯、蜡烛等）\nfluorescent lighting: 荧光灯\nfirelight: 火光\n6. 时间 (Time of Day)\nday time / daylight: 白天\nnight time: 夜晚\ndawn time / sunrise time: 黎明，日出\ndusk time / sunset time / golden hour: 黄昏，日落，黄金时刻\novercast: 阴天\n7. 色彩 (Color Tones)\nwarm colors: 暖色调 (黄、橙、红)\ncool colors: 冷色调 (蓝、绿、紫)\nsaturated colors: 高饱和度色彩\ndesaturated colors: 低饱和度/褪色色彩\nmonochrome: 单色\nmixed colors: 混合色彩\n8. 角色情绪 (Character Emotions)\nhappy: 开心\nsad: 悲伤\nangry: 愤怒\nsurprised: 惊讶\nfearful / scared: 恐惧\npensive / thoughtful: 沉思的\ncalm: 平静的\nanxious: 焦虑的\n9. 动作与动态 (Motion & Actions)\nrunning: 跑步\nwalking: 行走\ndancing: 跳舞\nfighting: 打斗\nskateboarding: 滑板\nplaying soccer: 踢足球\ncrying: 哭泣\nlaughing: 大笑\nspeaking: 说话\n10. 视觉风格 (Visual Styles)\nphotorealistic: 照片写实\ncinematic: 电影感\ndocumentary: 纪录片风格\nimpressionistic style: 印象派风格\noil painting style: 油画风格\nwatercolor painting: 水彩画\nclaymation style: 黏土动画风格\n2D anime style: 二维动漫风格\n3D game scene: 3D游戏场景\nblack and white animation: 黑白动画\n11. 特殊效果 (Special Effects)\nslow motion: 慢动作\nmotion blur: 动态模糊\nlens flare: 镜头光晕\nrain: 下雨\nsnow: 下雪\nfire: 火焰\nsmoke: 烟雾\nmagic effects: 魔法效果\n12. 附加描述词 (Additional Descriptors)\nretro: 复古\nfuturistic: 未来主义\nsurreal: 超现实\nwhimsical: 异想天开的\ngritty: 粗粝的\nelegant: 优雅的\n四、请使用中文生成的提示词\n五、生成字数在200字以内",[false,true]]},{"id":101,"type":"Text Concatenate","pos":[880,2030],"size":[315,178],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"文本_A","localized_name":"text_a","name":"text_a","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":126},{"label":"文本_B","localized_name":"text_b","name":"text_b","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":125},{"label":"文本_C","localized_name":"text_c","name":"text_c","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null},{"label":"文本_d","localized_name":"text_d","name":"text_d","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null},{"localized_name":"分隔符","name":"delimiter","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"delimiter"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"清理空白字符","name":"clean_whitespace","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clean_whitespace"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[127]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"Text Concatenate","ue_properties":{"version":"7.0.1","widget_ue_connectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[", ","true"],"color":"#223","bgcolor":"#335"},{"id":52,"type":"KSamplerAdvanced","pos":[3230,1410],"size":[304.748046875,841.5632934570312],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":38,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"模型","localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":62},{"label":"正面条件","localized_name":"正面条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","link":64},{"label":"负面条件","localized_name":"负面条件","name":"negative","type":"CONDITIONING","link":65},{"label":"Latent","localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image"